OL,3,GNEWSAThree sisters who drowned in sea
OL,4,Aoff Brighton took own lives, inquest
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree sisters who drowned in the sea
OL,8,Foff Brighton took their own lives, a
OL,9,Fcoroner has ruled.
OL,11,FJane Adetoro, 36, Christina Walters,
OL,12,F32, and Rebecca Walters, 31, had been
OL,13,Fliving "very secluded lives" following
OL,14,Fthe death of their mother, who drowned
OL,15,Fin 2010, senior coroner Penelope
OL,16,FSchofield said.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
