OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThree sisters who drowned in sea
OL,4,Aoff Brighton took own lives, inquest
OL,5,Afinds
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn 11 May, the women - who had all been
OL,8,Fliving together in Greenford, London -
OL,9,Fvisited an area of Birmingham close to
OL,10,Fwhere their mother died before
OL,11,Ftravelling the next day to Brighton
OL,12,Fbeach, where they drowned in adverse
OL,13,Fsea conditions in the early hours of 13
OL,14,FMay. The coroner said they could not
OL,15,Fswim.
OL,17,FTheir father Joseph Jacobsen said it
OL,18,Fwas heartbreaking to lose "all three of
OL,19,Fmy precious daughters".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
